From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:49:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] luci: protect wireless drafts and avoid writing implicit defaults

Track wireless form saves through the existing UCI baseline. Display the
radio and network status once below the channel. Show current standard,
region, and transmit power beneath the BSSID after the interface is up.
Check ACS syntax in the form and keep an absent cell density implicit.

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>

--- a/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/wireless-router-tool.js
+++ b/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/network/wireless-router-tool.js
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
